STRATEGY long_market_sizing_risk_usd_ticks_paper VERSION 1
-- SIZING RISK $ 50 over a 1.50 stop and contractSize 10 is 3.333 lots, quantized to 3.33; the 2.00 target fills
SYMBOLS
    syn = BACKTEST:SYN EVERY 1m
RULES
    WHEN syn.close = 100.50 AND POSITION.syn = 0
    THEN BUY syn SIZING RISK $ 50 BRACKET { STOP_LOSS BY 1.50, TAKE_PROFIT BY 2.00 }
